f the query (M).\nMeasure how trustworthy the web page is (T).\nConsider the aspects above and the relative importance of each, and decide on a final score (O).\n\nProduce a JSON object scores without providing any reasoning.\nExample: {\"M\": 2, \"T\": 1, \"O\": 1}", "llm_response": "```json\n{\"M\": 3, \"T\": 1, \"O\": 3}\n```", "llm_score": {"id": "UUID('d5b597f6-cc06-491e-8081-a1f4421f7f88')", "label": 3, "confidence": null, "rationale": null}, "event": "judgement_complete", "run_name": "noise-1-ensemble-1-google-gemma-3-4b-it-start", "run_type": "official", "cli": "infer", "level": "debug", "timestamp": "2026-01-12T12:19:09.964410Z"}
